<title>USA: Signal Apparel names David Houseman CFO/COO.</title>
<headline>Signal Apparel names David Houseman CFO/COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signal Apparel Co Inc said Wednesday that it appointed David Houseman chief financial officer and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Signal, the company said Houseman was senior vice president finance and chief financial officer of the privately-owned Bayer Clothing Group Inc.  </p>
<p>Signal said Houseman is replacing William Watts as CFO. Watts has resigned from the company.</p>
<p>The company said the COO position is newly created.</p>
